Applications suggested by Csíkszentmihályi versus other practitioners  [
[ edit  ](/w/index.php?title=Flow_\(psychology\)&action=edit&section=15 "Edit
section: Applications suggested by Csíkszentmihályi versus other
practitioners") ]

Only Csíkszentmihályi seems to have published suggestions for [ extrinsic
](/wiki/Extrinsic "Extrinsic") applications of the flow concept, such as [
design ](/wiki/Design "Design") methods for playgrounds to elicit the flow
experience. Other practitioners of Csíkszentmihályi's flow concept focus on [
intrinsic ](/wiki/Intrinsic_and_extrinsic_properties_\(philosophy\) "Intrinsic
and extrinsic properties \(philosophy\)") applications, such as [ spirituality
](/wiki/Spirituality "Spirituality") , [ performance improvement
](/wiki/Performance_improvement "Performance improvement") , or [ self-help
](/wiki/Self-help "Self-help") .

